      <h1>DC Motor Position: Frequency Domain Methods for Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>Key MATLAB commands used in this tutorial are: <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/toolbox/control/ref/tf.html"><tt>tf</tt></a> , <a href="http://www.mathworks.com/help/control/ref/controlsystemdesigner-app.html"><tt>controlSystemDesigner</tt></a></p>
      </div>
	  <div class="related_links">
      <h3>Related Tutorial Links</h3>
      <ul>
	    <li><a href="?example=Introduction&section=ControlFrequency">Freq Resp Intro</a></li>
        <li><a href="?aux=Activities_BoostcircuitC">Freq Resp Activity</a></li>
        <li><a href="?aux=Extras_Leadlag">Lead/Lag Freq Resp</a></li>
      </ul>
	  <h3>Related External Links</h3>
      <ul>
	    <li><a href="https://www.mathworks.com/videos/using-bode-plots-dc-motor-control-example-5-of-5-77062.html">MATLAB Motor Video</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://www.mathworks.com/videos/control-system-design-with-control-system-tuning-app-68749.html">Control System Designer App Video</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bkBMvGlAaho">Freq Resp Video</a></li>
